19	908	2026-09-13 16:59:38.944595	2026-09-13 16:59:38.944595	Also known as Waterfall on North Deep Creek and Styer Mill Falls.	jw
20	909	2026-09-13 17:01:30.847608	2026-09-13 17:01:30.847608	Cascading falls about 5 feet high on Avents Creek, Harnett County, Cape Fear basin. Reached by hiking trail; landowner is Raven Rock State Park. USGS quad Mamers. Watershed is very small. Beauty 4 and a 0.6 mile one-way hike per ncwaterfalls.com.	ncwaterfalls
21	360	2026-09-14 13:50:05.366666	2026-09-14 13:50:05.366666	Pretty, and hard to photograph. There is no good angle on it, the fence along the walkway ends up in most frames, and it is busy enough that people are in the rest. Worth seeing, and worth leaving the tripod in the car.	jw
